https same-origin                          -> accepted=True
cross-scheme http->https same host         -> accepted=True
cross-scheme explicit port                 -> accepted=True
example.com http->https                    -> accepted=True
sibling same-site                          -> accepted=False
other port                                 -> accepted=False
null origin                                -> accepted=False
no origin                                  -> accepted=True
